# Bonehoard Dracosaur's trigger is "your upkeep", "your library", "you may play": all the controller's. Bot1's Dracosaur is
# exiled by Bot2's Fractured Identity, which gives Bot2 a token copy; at Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 the COPY's trigger exiles
# the top two cards of BOT2's library (Mountain, Lightning Bolt), Bot2 makes the Dinosaur and the Treasure and casts the Bolt
# from exile at Bot1 with the Treasure; Bot1's library and board are untouched, and Bot1's upkeep on turn 3 did nothing.
# (No printed creature-stealing card is ported yet; the copy is the controller-is-not-the-original-player case there is.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Bonehoard Dracosaur
Island x3
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Fractured Identity
Island x3
Island
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

